        "subject": "LU-20869 tests: restore sleeps after sanity-quota resets",
        "message": "LU-20869 tests: restore sleeps after sanity-quota resets\n\nSince the sleeps after resetquota() and reset_quota_settings()\nwere removed, sanity-quota test_16a, test_16c and test_17 fail\nwith EDQUOT at a few MB of usage, and test_18 after them. The\nquota master holds a stale grant for the test user (LU-19908,\nseen before as test_12a and test_13 failures), and without the\npause after a reset it is no longer cleared before the later\ntests set new limits. Restore both sleeps until the master side\nis fixed; the shorter test_8 run stays.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-quota\nFixes: 7c229974c7cd (\"LU-20869 tests: drop fixed waits in sanity-quota\")\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I3d0044672f1c32e54ac548d7f4f834e767627e4c\n"
      },
